<title>SWITZERLAND: SNB's Gehrig says Sfr not clearly overvalued.</title>
<headline>SNB's Gehrig says Sfr not clearly overvalued.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bruno Gehrig, member of the Swiss National Bank's board, said the Swiss franc was no longer clearly overvalued, but its value was more justifiable.</p>
<p>Asked whether the franc was properly valued, Gehrig told reporters after a news conference:</p>
<p>&quot;I would certainly no longer say the franc clearly overvalued.</p>
<p>Asked whether it was properly valued, Gehrig said: &quot;It's justifiably valued.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
